{
  "title": "Revue Starlight &#8211; Special 3",
  "URL": "http://xenodude.com/2024/08/04/revue-starlight-special-3/",
  "content": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-attachment-id=\"62669\" data-permalink=\"http://xenodude.com/2024/08/04/revue-starlight-special-3/revue-starlight-special-3-2/\" data-orig-file=\"https://xenodude.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-2.png\" data-orig-size=\"1920,1080\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Revue Starlight Special 3-2\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://xenodude.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-2.png?w=1024\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" data-id=\"62669\" src=\"https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-2.png?w=1024\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-62669\" srcset=\"https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-2.png?w=1024 1024w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-2.png?w=150 150w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-2.png?w=300 300w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-2.png?w=768 768w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-2.png?w=1440 1440w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-2.png 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-attachment-id=\"62671\" data-permalink=\"http://xenodude.com/2024/08/04/revue-starlight-special-3/revue-starlight-special-3-4/\" data-orig-file=\"https://xenodude.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-4.png\" data-orig-size=\"1920,1080\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Revue Starlight Special 3-4\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://xenodude.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-4.png?w=1024\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" data-id=\"62671\" src=\"https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-4.png?w=1024\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-62671\" srcset=\"https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-4.png?w=1024 1024w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-4.png?w=150 150w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-4.png?w=300 300w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-4.png?w=768 768w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-4.png?w=1440 1440w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-4.png 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-attachment-id=\"62673\" data-permalink=\"http://xenodude.com/2024/08/04/revue-starlight-special-3/revue-starlight-special-3-6/\" data-orig-file=\"https://xenodude.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-6.png\" data-orig-size=\"1920,1080\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Revue Starlight Special 3-6\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://xenodude.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-6.png?w=1024\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" data-id=\"62673\" src=\"https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-6.png?w=1024\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-62673\" srcset=\"https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-6.png?w=1024 1024w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-6.png?w=150 150w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-6.png?w=300 300w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-6.png?w=768 768w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-6.png?w=1440 1440w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-6.png 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Given the countdown in the past two specials, I figured this miniseries would end with the Seisho festival. Sure enough, this episode takes place just minutes before the 99th class performs &#8220;Starlight&#8221;. Everyone is donning their costumes and getting their makeup done. Well, everyone except Karen. More on her in a bit.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There&#8217;s a fun scene where Kaoruko and Claudine talk about the situation and complain about their respective girlfriends. Funny how this show has a lot of pairings but it&#8217;s until now where the characters talk about them to each other like friends would about their partners. I suppose it&#8217;s better late than never. Considering how much Futaba and Maya pushes their respective buttons, it&#8217;s perfect that this conversation is between Kaoruko and Claudine.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The two then notice Hikari having a bad case of stage fright, to the point that she&#8217;s screwing up her makeup. That&#8217;s definitely a rare sight. If anyone exudes confidence, it&#8217;s Hikari. The only time we&#8217;ve ever seen her freeze up is in Episode 8 and that was under a very special circumstance. Fortunately, everyone helps her calm down in a variety of ways. I think what I appreciate most about these specials is that it allows Hikari to interact more with the rest of the crew. I had no problem with the few scenes in the main show, where this sort of thing happened, but I can&#8217;t deny that it was only a couple of scenes. It was definitely something that could&#8217;ve been expanded on so I&#8217;m glad to see it happen in the specials.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So as it turns out, there actually is a reason why Karen has been practicing baseball. She apparently wanted to get Hikari a giant plush of Mr. White, a polar bear mascot that the latter is fond of (you can see Hikari&#8217;s own plush of the character in her dorm room and her Stage Girl outfit). Karen found one at a local batting cage but to obtain it, she has to hit a 160 km/h ball (10 km higher than Mahiru&#8217;s high score), hence her training during these specials. It&#8217;s silly, especially given how close Karen was cutting it. At the same time, this is the most Karen thing for Karen to do and it&#8217;s incredibly cute that she went out of her way to get Hikari a gift to cheer her up and calm her down on the big day.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The special ends right before the play starts, with everyone piling their hands together and Karen giving some final words before they all perform. I kind of wish this was in the final episode. Like, it isn&#8217;t a necessary to have but it&#8217;s still a nice and introspective note to end the story on.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Overall, I say these specials are optional but they&#8217;re nevertheless a nice addition to the TV show. Being a huge fan of the main show, it&#8217;s nice to spend a little bit more time with it. Had I stayed on top with <em>Revue Starlight</em> back then, I would&#8217;ve been sad to see the show go again but fortunately, there&#8217;s still a couple more installments for me to check out.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-attachment-id=\"62667\" data-permalink=\"http://xenodude.com/2024/08/04/revue-starlight-special-3/revue-starlight-special-3-1/\" data-orig-file=\"https://xenodude.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-1.png\" data-orig-size=\"1920,1080\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Revue Starlight Special 3-1\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://xenodude.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-1.png?w=1024\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" data-id=\"62667\" src=\"https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-1.png?w=1024\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-62667\" srcset=\"https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-1.png?w=1024 1024w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-1.png?w=150 150w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-1.png?w=300 300w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-1.png?w=768 768w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-1.png?w=1440 1440w, https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-1.png 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-attachment-id=\"62670\" data-permalink=\"http://xenodude.com/2024/08/04/revue-starlight-special-3/revue-starlight-special-3-3/\" data-orig-file=\"https://xenodude.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-3.png\" data-orig-size=\"1920,1080\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Revue Starlight Special 3-3\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://xenodude.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-3.png?w=1024\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" data-id=\"62670\" src=\"https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-3.png?w=1024\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-62670\" srcset=\"https://xenodude.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/revue-starlight-special-3-3